{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17554","headline":"和权载之离合诗 · 潘孟阳","name":"和权载之离合诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"咏歌有离合，永夜观酬荅。\n笥中操彩牋，竹简何足编。\n意深俱妙绝，心契交情结。\n计彼官接联，言初竝清切。\n翔集本相随，羽仪良在斯。\n烟云竞文藻，因喜翫新诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘孟阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}